{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-06-12T14:36:13.124Z","tool_name":"replace","tool_id":"replace__r7ib8egp","parameters":{"new_string":"impl Dom {\n    /// Returns true if `other` is an inclusive descendant of `node`\n    /// (i.e. `other` is `node` itself, or a descendant of `node`).\n    // spec: https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-node-contains\n    pub fn contains(&self, node: NodeId, other: NodeId) -> bool {\n        let mut curr = Some(other);\n        while let Some(curr_node) = curr {\n            if curr_node == node {\n                return true;\n            }\n            curr = self.parent(curr_node);\n        }\n        false\n    }\n\n    /// Returns the first element in the document with the given `id`.","file_path":"src/dom/query.rs","instruction":"Add the `contains` method to the `impl Dom` block in `src/dom/query.rs` as specified.","old_string":"impl Dom {\n    /// Returns the first element in the document with the given `id`."}}
